{"title":"Bodkin Arrow","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\">\n      <p class=\"wp-lede\">Crafted (Bowyer Lv 25) · Monster drop: Boar, Seagull</p>\n      \n      \n      \n      \n      \n      <h2>How to get it</h2>\n      \n      \n      <p><b>Crafted</b> with Bowyer at level 25 <span class=\"muted\">(47 XP)</span> from 10× <a href=\"#/item/arrow\">Arrow</a>, 1× <a href=\"#/item/iron-bar\">Iron Bar</a>, 1× <a href=\"#/item/flight-feather\">Flight Feather</a>.</p>\n      \n      \n      <div style=\"margin-top:10px\"><b>Recorded monster drops</b><div class=\"chip-row\"><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink\" data-monster=\"boar\" title=\"Boar - dropped it in 2 of 30 looted corpses (1/15)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/d7731346cea2e7cf972b.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Boar</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/15<br>×3</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink\" data-monster=\"seagull\" title=\"Seagull - dropped it in 1 of 29 looted corpses (1/29)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/856135c5dda563fb9bf0.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Seagull</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/29<br>×1</span></div></div><div class=\"s muted\" style=\"margin-top:6px\">Drop rate as 1/X (about 1 kill in X drops it, counted over the corpses of each monster whose loot was recorded), and ×N, how many come in one drop.</div></div>\n      <button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"item\" data-map-id=\"bodkin-arrow\">Show where to get it on the map</button>\n      <p class=\"wp-guides\"><b>Guides:</b> <a href=\"#/guide/bowyer\">Bowyer</a></p>\n      \n      \n      <h2>Related</h2><p class=\"rel-row\"><b>Made from</b> <a class=\"rel-chip\" href=\"#/item/arrow\"><img class=\"q-mini\" src=\"data/img/f8e0f872cc502e1dabe7.svg\" alt=\"\">Arrow</a><a class=\"rel-chip\" href=\"#/item/iron-bar\"><img class=\"q-mini\" src=\"data/img/b05bccaf779cfe4ebfbe.svg\" alt=\"\">Iron Bar</